nemo — Unified workspace CLI for Nemo's continuous improvement system

Commands:
    nemo focus [minutes] [message]  — Minimalist focus timer
    nemo track [add|done|list|rm]   — Daily task tracker
    nemo ci [log|stats|visualize]   — Continuous improvement cycles
    nemo diary [entry]              — Quick diary entry
    nemo work [on|add|rm|log|here]  — Project context management
    nemo list                       — List all available skills
    nemo <skill> [args...]          — Run any skill from skills/

Principles:
    - Less, but better (Dieter Rams)
